From a76f8ff9a22ed924154d3fd8047d49a785be2975 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 31 Mar 2026 22:21:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Major updates: Translation system, Favicon, Founder image,
 Product pages, Checkout system

## Translation System
- Complete Arabic translation for homepage content
- Updated QuizPreviewWidget and DailyReflectionPreview for i18n
- Replaced GoogleTranslateWidget with custom LanguageSwitcher
- Full RTL support for Arabic language

## Favicon
- Created new favicon with bold 'T' letter for better visibility
- Generated all required sizes (16x16 to 512x512)
- Added site.webmanifest for PWA support
- Updated layout.tsx with complete favicon configuration

## Founder Image
- Changed from rectangular to circular shape (more human and warm)
- Added gradient accent ring around image
- Added subtle glow effect
- Processed image from founde.png source

## Image Organization
- Organized uploaded images into categorized folders
- Created folders: logos, favicons, founder, screenshots, banners, other

## Product Pages
- Created individual product pages (/products/[slug])
- 4 products: Trial (), Planner (7), Premium (7), Bundle (7)
- Rich content: description, features, testimonials, FAQs
- Updated main products page to link to individual pages

## Checkout System
- Updated checkout page for direct product purchase
- Updated API for direct purchase from product page
- Access code generation and database storage
- Proper tier assignment (TRIAL, BASIC, PREMIUM, BUNDLE)

## Payment Integration (Prepared)
- Added Tahweel payment integration files
- Created payment success/cancel pages
- Added webhook handler for payment confirmation
